# The ROM is copyrighted commercial software and is NOT part of this repo.
# The repo root is advisor/, and the ROM lives in the parent directory, so it is
# outside the tree by design. These patterns are belt-and-braces in case anyone
# moves files around later.
*.gba
*.gb
*.gbc
*.nds
*.sav
*.srm
*.ss[0-9]

# EXCEPT the measurement fixtures, which are checked in deliberately.
#
# Every seeded sweep under tests/fixtures/ was taken on one of these boards, and
# the tests replay those sweeps on every run. Without the save states the
# measurements are unreproducible: you could read the numbers but never re-take
# them, and A10 is the standing proof that these boards carry properties nobody
# thought to write down. A recipe only reproduces what someone remembered to
# record.
#
# They are not ROM data and do not weaken the rule above. An mGBA save state is
# a PNG: a 240x160 screenshot of the frame, plus gbAs/gbAx chunks holding a
# compressed snapshot of the console's RAM. 83 KB against a 4 MB ROM, and the
# ROM is not in there -- you still have to supply your own for any of this to
# run.
!harness/fixtures/*.ss[0-9]

# Emulator binaries and archives -- download mGBA yourself, don't vendor it.
*.7z
emulator/
mGBA*/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
